# Battle against Spectrier (the swift ghost steed): a gallop ticking on the hats, a darting F-sharp-minor saw lead,
# a church organ's counter-line and a ghostly choir. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Spectrier
tempo 184
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.38

track lead sawlead lowhp=square vol=0.77 pan=0 rev=0.32
  o5 c+8 f+8 a8 o6 c+8 f+4 r4 | o6 e+4 d+8 c+8 o5 g+2 |
